Z||000000||KnightRyder31||04-27-2000||11:14 AM||||Would the borla system increase any performence? I want to buy a exhaust system in the summer, when I have more time. I'm just wondering how much of a diffrence would I notice?||||reg||5
Z||000001||Old Lar||04-27-2000||01:39 PM||||Supposed to give a 5-25 hp improvement.  I never noticed any real improvement. The car always moved out real good.  Since I'm not into drags, no time sheets to show any improvements or no dyno tests to demonstrate improvements.  I got the Borla system because the stock system was old and needed repair. The chrome tips looked nice and I shouldn't have to replace it for 10 years or a million miles.||||reg||1
Z||000002||KnightRyder31||04-27-2000||03:19 PM||||Well I only haave a four cyl. Would that matter? I could still put that Borla system on my car? I looked on the Fiero store one day, and I saw a duel exhaust system....but it said it was for the six cyl. Does it really matter what type of engine you have in order to put a exhaust system on?||||reg||5
Z||000003||88formula||04-27-2000||04:35 PM||||Dynoed at 7 HP. You wont notice that.||||reg||1
